  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project consists of a financing in Colombian Pesos (&#x201C;COP&#x201D;) for an amount equivalent toUS$50million. The financing will have a tenor of five years and will be amortized on its maturity day (bullet). IDB Invest shall be entitled to share the amount of the financing with other investors. The funds will be used to support the growth of the green and social portfolio of Banco Finandina BIC S.A. (&#x201C;Banco Finandina&#x201D;, &#x201C;Finandina&#x201D; or the &#x201C;Bank&#x201D;).</narrative>
  </description>
